  "description": "Lee Seung-Hwa, a transfer student, arrives in the quiet rural village of Guam-ri. He beats class president Woo Ho-Young without warning and announces to his classmates: \"Woo Ho-Young's father, Woo Sang-Cheol, is a murderer who killed two people, including his own father.\" With everyone turning their backs on him, Woo Ho-Young meets someone who understands him and begins to heal his wounded heart.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
